        <mxCell id="6" value="- Added 27 source-aware white box cases in ../tests/test_white_box.py (../tests/test_white_box.py). The preliminary automated run on commit 8591467 recorded 27 passes and 96% branch-measured coverage across the selected allocation, routing, and model modules. The JUnit record and coverage JSON are in evidence/ (evidence/). Pratibha Yadav&amp;#x27;s own execution and sign-off remain pending." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5E1EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172B42;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
