        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" value="- Prepared 22 black box cases for Garv Agrawal. Their actual results remain pending because he has not run them and the Docker engine was unavailable for this round. See DRRAS_testing_report.drawio (DRRAS_testing_report.drawio) for expected results, procedures, evidence rules, and closure work." style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5E1EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172B42;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
